  "raw_label": "appellant_won",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Loganathan vs The Commissioner on 18 July, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.192 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 18.07.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.19282 of 2024 and W.M.P.No.21145 of 2024 Loganathan ... Petitioner -Vs- The Commissioner, Food Safety & Administration Department, 359, Anna Salai, Dms Campus, Teynampet, Chennai 600 006. ... Respondent Prayer:- Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of Constitution of I for the issuance of Writ of Mandamus, calling for the records of th respondent in connection with the impugned order passed by him in R.No.5932/2020/S1/FSD dated 24.09.2020 and R.No.5932/2020/S1/FSD dated 10.05.2021 and quash the same and direct the respondents to reinstate the petitioner into service and grant him all consequenti service and monetary benefits. For Petitioner : Mr.K.Venkataramani, Senior Couns for Mr.M.Muthappan For Respondent : Mr.E.Vijay Anand Additional Government Pleader Page 1 of 8 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P. Order",
    "facts": "The petitioner was serving as Food Safety Officer, Ambattur Municipality. While being so, the petitioner was arrested and remanded to judicial custody, pursuant to the registration of FIR in Crime No.8 of 2020, on the file of Inspector of Police, Special Investigation Cell, V and AC Department, on the complaint lodged by one Mohan, alleging that the said Mohan and his sister are running a departmental store in Anna Salai, Thiruverkadu, Chennai. On the complaint, a trap was set up and the petitioner got red- handed. While being so, the petitioner submitted a representation for revocation of his order of suspension and the same was also rejected by an order dated 10.05.2021. In view of the pendency of investigation, the petitioner was also not served any charge memo so far to initiate disciplinary proceedings. In fact, subsequently, the petitioner also submitted a representation for revocation of his suspension and the same was rejected by an order dated 08.07.2024. 5.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
